{{also|TUR|Tur|tur|tür|tùr|Túr|túr|tűr}}
==German==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|de|Thür}}, {{l|de|Thüre}} {{qualifier|obsolete}}
* {{l|de|Türe}} {{qualifier|dated, regional}}

===Etymology===
{{PIE root|de|dʰwer}}
From {{inh|de|gmh|-}}, from {{inh|de|goh|turi}}, from {{der|de|gem-pro|*durz}}, from {{der|de|ine-pro|*dʰwer-||doorway, door, gate}}. Compare English {{m|en|door}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/tyːr/|/tyːɐ̯/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-Tür.OGG|audio|lang=de}}
* {{rhymes|yːɐ̯|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f||Türen|Türchen|dim2=Türlein}}

# [[door]]
#: {{ux|de|Plötzlich klopft es an die '''Tür'''.|Suddenly one knocks on the <b>door</b>.}}
#: {{ux|de|Kannst du bitte die '''Tür''' zumachen!|Can you please shut the <b>door!</b>}}

